  "fullDescription": "Bold blue botanical flowers burst against a vivid golden-yellow background in this hand-painted watercolor surface pattern, perfect for sublimation printing and bold textile design.\n\nThis striking repeat pattern features large open anemone-style blooms rendered in expressive brushwork, their petals blending steel blue, dusty blue, and soft periwinkle with warm orange undertones peeking through for depth and dimension. Sweeping dark teal botanical branches carry detailed leaves and delicate berry clusters, creating a lush, full-coverage composition reminiscent of classic toile and chinoiserie traditions reimagined in a modern, painterly hand. The vivid cadmium yellow and amber background commands attention and gives the design an unmistakably joyful, high-contrast energy.\n\nThe mood is bold yet romantic — channeling vintage botanical illustration meets maximalist folk art, with a sun-drenched Mediterranean warmth. This design is ideal for sublimation transfers, fabric yardage, POD apparel, tote bags, throw pillows, gift wrap, wallpaper murals, scrapbooking papers, journal covers, and Canva template backgrounds. Compatible with Photoshop, Procreate, and Illustrator workflows, it prints beautifully at 300 DPI across a 13×13 inch tile for seamless repeat applications.",
